WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.216
Before you spend three months building an AI feature, spend one week finding out if it'll actually hold up.

00:06.216 --> 00:15.164
That's the audit. One week — I go deep on your feature or agent: the prompts, the retrieval, and the edge cases where it quietly breaks.

00:15.164 --> 00:25.742
I build a real evaluation harness against your actual use cases, run it, and score it. Not vibes — numbers.

00:25.742 --> 00:36.040
At the end, you get a plan either way: failure modes ranked by risk, and exactly what it takes to make it production-safe.

00:36.040 --> 00:41.645
And if your feature is already solid, I'll tell you that too. Either way, you stop guessing.

00:41.645 --> 00:47.339
One week. One clear answer. Book the audit — and find out what your AI actually does.

